    {
      "id": "pace-local-identity",
      "topic": "pace",
      "text": "Hope PACE is a separate, conditional coverage path for Collier residents. CMS’s October 2026 directory lists Hope PACE under contract H5934, and Florida AHCA’s August 2026 report lists its Collier service area as operational. This is not an extra benefit added to a Medicare Advantage plan.",
      "review_status": "publisher_source_check; qualified_domain_review_pending",
