    {
      "id": "pace-eligibility",
      "topic": "pace",
      "text": "PACE requires age 55 or older, residence in the organization’s service area, a state-certified need for nursing-home-level care, and the ability to live safely in the community with PACE’s help. Hope PACE lists Charlotte, Collier and Lee counties. A ZIP match or a diagnosis alone does not establish eligibility; Hope PACE and the state must assess the individual.",
      "review_status": "publisher_source_check; qualified_domain_review_pending",
      "evidence": [
