    {
      "id": "pace-costs",
      "topic": "pace",
      "text": "PACE costs depend on coverage. Medicaid participants do not pay a monthly PACE premium. People with Medicare only or private-pay coverage need an individual premium estimate. Cost-sharing protections apply to care approved by the PACE team; unauthorized or out-of-program services can leave the participant responsible for costs.",
      "review_status": "publisher_source_check; qualified_domain_review_pending",
