    {
      "id": "pace-contact",
      "topic": "pace",
      "text": "To ask about Hope PACE, call 239-985-6400 or 866-659-7223. Ask the enrollment specialist to confirm the home address is in the service area and explain the assessment and costs. The Naples center is at 13020 Livingston Road, Suite 3, Naples, FL 34105. This app does not collect an address or send a referral.",
      "review_status": "publisher_source_check; qualified_domain_review_pending",
