    {
      "id": "shine-referral",
      "topic": "shine",
      "text": "For Medicare counseling, contact Florida SHINE at 1-800-963-5337 (TTY 1-800-955-8770), or use its official counseling request page. Ask for a Collier County appointment. SHINE can help review coverage choices and unresolved questions; exact provider participation still needs confirmation with the plan and provider.",
