      "id": "shine-collier-sites",
      "topic": "shine",
      "text": "The official Collier SHINE directory lists counseling by appointment at Alzheimer’s Support Network, 1421 Pine Ridge Road, Naples: call 239-262-8388. It also lists Baker Senior Center Naples, 6200 Autumn Oaks Lane, for members only; call 866-413-5337 to request counseling. Dates vary, so confirm the appointment before going.",
