    {
      "id": "coordination-employer",
      "topic": "coordination_employer_union",
      "text": "Before adding or changing Medicare coverage alongside employer or union retiree coverage, ask the benefits administrator how medical and drug benefits coordinate. Joining Medicare drug coverage can affect retiree coverage for the person, spouse or dependents. Check whether the current drug coverage is creditable and whether dropped benefits can be restored; this app has not verified the employer’s rules.",
      "review_status": "publisher_source_check; qualified_domain_review_pending",
      "evidence": [
