    {
      "id": "coordination-tricare",
      "topic": "coordination_tricare",
      "text": "TRICARE For Life requires confirmation of TRICARE eligibility and Medicare Part A and Part B. In most cases, a person eligible for TRICARE and Medicare Part A needs Part B to keep TRICARE. Part D is not required for TRICARE prescription coverage. Confirm the person’s benefit and coordination rules with TRICARE before changing coverage; this app does not determine eligibility.",
      "review_status": "publisher_source_check; qualified_domain_review_pending",
