    {
      "id": "coordination-medigap",
      "topic": "coordination_existing_medigap",
      "text": "An older Medigap policy may include benefits that are no longer sold. Medicare’s Medigap guide says a canceled older policy cannot be recovered. Some older policies include prescription benefits; review those benefits, creditable coverage and replacement rights with the insurer and SHINE before dropping a policy or adding Part D. No replacement coverage or acceptance has been established here.",
